Subject: [PATCH 34/58] qwen4_exp: restore torch.compile on the NVIDIA path;
 exact breakable pin; runtime graph-mode assertion

- torch.compile restored on the NVIDIA Qwen4Exp target and MTP so the
  production profile (VLLM_COMPILE + FULL_AND_PIECEWISE, breakable off) runs.
- The production pin requires VLLM_USE_BREAKABLE_CUDAGRAPH to be exactly "0".
- assert_resolved_cudagraph_modes() runs at the top of capture_model.
- CPU tests for the combined profile, the exact pin and the resolved modes.
